[Manual Verification Info]
To verify physical D-Bus & Sysfs status of the Identify LED during blinking:
1. SSH into the BMC: ssh root@192.168.0.57 (Password: 0penBmc)
2. Check D-Bus:      busctl get-property xyz.openbmc_project.LED.Controller /xyz/openbmc_project/led/physical/front_id xyz.openbmc_project.Led.Physical State
3. Check Kernel trigger: cat /sys/class/leds/front_id/trigger (Should show [timer])

